        "original_id": "e7faecdd-3cbf-517d-ab13-3bfef1c4b28e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: George Harrison, Ravi Shankar, the Beatles\n- Products: Dark Horse\n- Events: Dark Horse release, Harrison and Shankar's 1974 North American tour, the Beatles' 1966 US tour\n- Places: North America, America\n\nFacts:\n- In August 1966, the Beatles staged their third concert tour of America.\n- The Beatles' August 1966 tour of America was the last commercial tour they ever undertook.\n- In November and December 1974, George Harrison staged a controversial North American tour with co-headliner Ravi Shankar.\n- George Harrison's album Dark Horse was keenly anticipated on release.\n- Dark Horse is associated with George Harrison and Ravi Shankar's controversial North American tour in November and December 1974.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
